00:21:12.390 --> 00:21:13.700
Now, it sounds good.

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:15.260
Is that possible today?

00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:16.665
I think it is.

00:21:16.665 --> 00:21:17.540
Is it done right now?

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:18.075
No.

00:21:18.075 --> 00:21:19.700
Everyone's trying to
get to that level.

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:21.110
ROB SADOWSKI: Right.

